# The README's motion stills are tracked on purpose: they are the only part of the
# showcase a visitor sees without downloading anything. Everything else under
# artifacts/ stays out of the history and is force-added file by file when a
# published artifact needs to travel with the source.
!docs/media/
!docs/media/*.gif
.coverage
htmlcov/
/artifacts/
.env
dataset-lock.json

